<title>UK: European cotton in familiar watch-and-wait pattern.</title>
<headline>European cotton in familiar watch-and-wait pattern.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mills were covering gaps in short-term inventory but enquiry for new crop cotton stayed very cautious.</p>
<p>Price ideas at origin were firm with sellers reluctant to discount forward shipment offers so early in the growing season.</p>
</text>
